224
00:11:14.174 --> 00:11:15.675
MANTAN WALIKOTA BYEON JONGSIK
DITINDAKKAN KARENA SUAP

225
00:11:15.758 --> 00:11:17.177
DAN PELANGGARAN UU DANA POLITIK

226
00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:18.761
